OL,3,GNEWSAMum says family 'lucky to be
OL,4,Aalive' after train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail passenger has told how she feels
OL,7,F"lucky to be alive" after her train
OL,8,Fcrashed with a van, killing the
OL,9,Fdelivery driver.
OL,11,FSophie Cassidy was travelling in the
OL,12,Ftrain when it hit a van on a railway
OL,13,Fline. The van driver died at the scene
OL,14,Fin Burscough, West Lancashire, just
OL,15,Fafter 15:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,17,FThe 26-year-old's daughter was hit by
OL,18,Fflying glass when the door to the
OL,19,FNorthern train driver's compartment
OL,20,Fsheered off its hinges in the crash on
OL,21,Fthe Wigan Wallgate-Southport train.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
