OL,3,GNEWSAMum says family 'lucky to be
OL,4,Aalive' after train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother-of-two told the BBC: "I
OL,7,Fcan't put into words how lucky we are
OL,8,Fto be alive. I'm still trying to wrap
OL,9,Fmy mind around it all."
